  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s01",
      "index": 1,
      "startSec": 0.01,
      "endSec": 3.49,
      "text": "It's getting late and we're both displaying signs of weariness."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s02",
      "index": 2,
      "startSec": 3.55,
      "endSec": 7.01,
      "text": "I think we should call it a day and meet again tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s03",
      "index": 3,
      "startSec": 7.28,
      "endSec": 9.6,
      "text": "We are so close."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s04",
      "index": 4,
      "startSec": 9.78,
      "endSec": 11.46,
      "text": "Don't you think we're almost done?"
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s05",
      "index": 5,
      "startSec": 11.7,
      "endSec": 13.68,
      "text": "Let's do two more hours, please."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s06",
      "index": 6,
      "startSec": 14.72,
      "endSec": 16.5,
      "text": "One hour, then I'm going home."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s07",
      "index": 7,
      "startSec": 16.76,
      "endSec": 17.5,
      "text": "OK, fine."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s08",
      "index": 8,
      "startSec": 17.5,
      "endSec": 23.96,
      "text": "I think we are making good progress and that with a few more amendments we will be all done."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s09",
      "index": 9,
      "startSec": 24.48,
      "endSec": 26.12,
      "text": "I'm sure looking forward to it."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s10",
      "index": 10,
      "startSec": 26.28,
      "endSec": 28.14,
      "text": "I'm so tired of this project."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s11",
      "index": 11,
      "startSec": 28.64,
      "endSec": 29.34,
      "text": "Don't get me wrong."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s12",
      "index": 12,
      "startSec": 30.09,
      "endSec": 36.22,
      "text": "Don't get me wrong—it's a great professional opportunity for me and a milestone for the company, but it's just been so long."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s13",
      "index": 13,
      "startSec": 36.77,
      "endSec": 41.41,
      "text": "Yeah, two months working on nothing but the same contract is a little tough."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s14",
      "index": 14,
      "startSec": 41.59,
      "endSec": 46.07,
      "text": "Nevertheless, I think that with a bit of luck we'll be done by next week."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s15",
      "index": 15,
      "startSec": 47.24,
      "endSec": 48.86,
      "text": "You must be delusional."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s16",
      "index": 16,
      "startSec": 49.06,
      "endSec": 50.0,
      "text": "You don't think so?"
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s17",
      "index": 17,
      "startSec": 50.32,
      "endSec": 51.28,
      "text": "No chance."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s18",
      "index": 18,
      "startSec": 51.68,
      "endSec": 56.62,
      "text": "Sections four, five, eight and nine still have to be aligned in the new framework."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s19",
      "index": 19,
      "startSec": 57.28,
      "endSec": 62.28,
      "text": "Then we need to proofread the whole thing and make sure all selling points are watertight."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s20",
      "index": 20,
      "startSec": 62.54,
      "endSec": 65.51,
      "text": "But that will all take no more than a couple of days."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s21",
      "index": 21,
      "startSec": 65.84,
      "endSec": 67.01,
      "text": "I wasn't finished."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s22",
      "index": 22,
      "startSec": 67.22,
      "endSec": 71.23,
      "text": "When we are done with it and send it upstairs, what do you think will happen? / W: What?"
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s23",
      "index": 23,
      "startSec": 71.6,
      "endSec": 72.08,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s24",
      "index": 24,
      "startSec": 72.34,
      "endSec": 74.64,
      "text": "They'll argue about it for like a month."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s25",
      "index": 25,
      "startSec": 75.11,
      "endSec": 79.84,
      "text": "There's always going to be the odd board member who intervenes and demands rectifications be made."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s26",
      "index": 26,
      "startSec": 80.39,
      "endSec": 85.25,
      "text": "They might think they're being helpful but in reality they're being obstructive and hampering progress."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s27",
      "index": 27,
      "startSec": 85.69,
      "endSec": 88.61,
      "text": "Oh Jeff, you're too preoccupied and cynical."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s28",
      "index": 28,
      "startSec": 89.17,
      "endSec": 90.99,
      "text": "It won't be anywhere as bad as that."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s29",
      "index": 29,
      "startSec": 90.99,
      "endSec": 91.57,
      "text": "You'll see."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s30",
      "index": 30,
      "startSec": 92.06,
      "endSec": 97.66,
      "text": "The entire managerial hierarchy wants to see this project implemented as soon as possible and the board too is virtually unanimous in its support."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s31",
      "index": 31,
      "startSec": 98.05,
      "endSec": 101.23,
      "text": "And the board, too, is virtually unanimous in its support."
    },
    {
      "materialId": "cet6-202512-conv2",
      "materialVersion": "v1",
      "sentenceId": "s32",
      "index": 32,
      "startSec": 101.8,
      "endSec": 105.28,
      "text": "Go on then, let's stop there and meet up again, same time tomorrow."
    }
  ],
